"""Support for PAML."""
PK␀␀␀␀␀¼+£Vž5È¾␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Bio/Phylo/PAML/_paml.py# Copyright (C) 2011 by Brandon Invergo (b.invergo@gmail.com)
#
