AF@#(␀#Aé␀j (!␀@ ("AF@ ␀#Aç␀jE ␀#Aå␀jE  6   ␀6$#(␀#A´j A j ("␀AG@  ␀6#(␀#A™j AjA€€ (("AF  6␀#(␀#Aîj  	A␀!␀ A0j$␀ ␀ƒ␀#üconvert␀start␀Parser for DNA sequence data in 2bit format␀nBlocks␀maskBlocks␀step␀end␀data␀_twoBitIO␀L␀I␀blocks have unexpected format.␀unexpected number of bytes %u (expected %u)␀blocks have incorrect data type (itemsize %zd, format %s)␀blocks should have two columns (found %zd)␀blocks have incorrect rank %d (expected 2)␀y#nnnO&O&␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀[␀␀␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀°␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀convert twoBit data to the DNA sequence, apply blocks of N's (representing unknown sequences) and masked (lower case) blocks, and return the sequence as a bytes object␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀V␀␀␀␀␀␀R␀␀␀M␀␀␀:␀␀␀B␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀,target_features+mutable-globals+sign-extPK␀␀␀␀␀¼+£V§ç&B·␀␀·␀␀␀␀␀Bio/SeqUtils/CheckSum.py# Copyright 2002 by Yves Bastide and Brad Chapman.
