¶C␀␀À ␀8␀ Aj! Aj" G␀#"␀ ␀(␀Aj6␀  6␀  6  6#(␀#A‚j  A0j AÜ␀j Aj$␀ ␀º#␀A k"$␀@@ ␀E␀ ␀ A<AF@ (",␀␀"␀A!k"AK␀A tA€€À{qE␀ -␀!␀ ␀AÿqAæ␀G@  ␀À6#(␀#A˜j AjA€€ ("AF  6␀#(␀#Aèj  A␀!␀ A j$␀ ␀ò#␀A0k"$␀@@ ␀E␀ ␀ A<AF@#(␀#@ (",␀␀"␀A!k"AK␀A tA€€À{qE␀ -␀!␀ ␀AÿqAä␀G@  ␀À6 #(␀#AÔj A j ("␀AG@  ␀6#(␀#A®j AjA€€ (("AF  6␀#(␀#Aêj  A␀!␀ A0j$␀ ␀÷␀#ðposition-weight matrix is not an array␀matrix␀scores␀Fast calculations involving position-weight matrices␀_pwm␀calculate␀sequence␀size of scores array is inconsistent (sequence length is %zd, motif length is %zd, scores length is %zd␀position-weight matrix should have four columns (%zd columns found)␀position-weight matrix has incorrect rank (%d expected 2)␀scores array has incorrect rank (%d expected 1)␀scores array has incorrect data format ('%c', expected 'f')␀position-weight matrix data format incorrect ('%c', expected 'd')␀y#O&O&␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀j␀␀␀5␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿ`␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀o␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀€␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀    calculate(sequence, pwm, scores)

This function calculates the position-weight matrix scores for all
positions along the sequence for position-weight matrix pwm, and stores
them in the provided numpy array scores.
